say "GREEN drey: the whole Mikrophone firmware journey holds — mikrophone session · mikrophone wire · mikrophone recorder · mikrophone firmware · mikrophone inbox · mikrophone carry · mikrophone archive · mikrophone catalog · mikrophone manifest · mikrophone serve · mikrophone redact · mikrophone sync · mikrophone forget · mikrophone push · mikrophone reconcile · mikrophone verify, all sixteen rungs proven pure before metal in one command; no disk, no network, no key, no funds."
